  "prompt": "Which products earned more 2025 net revenue than the average product of their category? Use the sales rows whose order_date falls in 2025, and average over the products of the category with sales in 2025. Compare with the exact average. Return four columns, in this order: category_name, product_id, revenue (the product's 2025 net revenue) and category_avg, the category's average product revenue rounded to 2 decimals. Return one row for each such product. Any row order is fine.",
